      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i guess. but it doesn't change the reality of it. even if i'm more than a number, the system doesn't care. everything feels so permanent and heavy. like this loop is the only thing that's ever going to exist. it's just this endless, empty cycle and i'm stuck in it. there's no way out of it, is there? just keeps going until we die.",
